      "key": "line:Widow_Armpit_DontShoot_022968d",
      "source": "Widow: Уууф. Потом наставил ружьё.",
      "target": "Widow: Húúf. Aztán rám fogtad a puskát.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-456.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15667,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451998031881",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Widow_Armpit_DontShoot_058ddf1",
      "source": "Widow: Сейчас...",
      "target": "Widow: Egy pillanat...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-456.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15668,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451998031880",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Widow_Armpit_DontShoot_0856785",
      "source": "Widow: Унизить человека, который только недавно потерял...",
      "target": "Widow: Megalázni valakit, aki csak nemrég veszített el...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-456.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15669,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504451998031879",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Widow_Armpit_DontShoot_093dbbe",
      "source": "Widow: Не могу тебя понять. И не хочу.",
      "target": "Widow: Nem értelek. És nem is akarlak.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-456.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
